            "review_title": "Review at Quan Ho Tren Nui",
            "review_text": "Peter K\nRyde, Australia571 contributions\n0\nRustic and well off the beaten track\nDec 2023 • Family\nStayed nearby and this restaurant was recommended by hotel staff. Family run and not somewhere that I would normally seek out but the experience was great.\nCan't get more authentic Vietnamese if you tried. Staff are very friendly, food is plentiful, delicious and no one could argue with the cost as it is very much local prices. Probably best if you have a local friend.\nRead more\nWritten December 9, 2023",
